1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,311
At dusk, Milo found a little lantern on an old tree stump. He decided to carry its warm light along the forest path.

2
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:26,303
Two wooden arrows pointed in different directions. Milo paused and listened, because a quiet sound was coming from the darker path.

3
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,017
Milo decided that kindness mattered more than speed. He shared a broad leaf with a frightened rabbit until the rain grew softer.

4
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,777
At the wooden bridge, the rabbit was afraid of the dark water. Milo held the lantern low so they could see each careful step.

5
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:20,392
A small cottage waited beyond the trees. Its round window glowed warmly, and the two friends finally had a safe place to rest.

6
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:38,423
By sunrise, the lantern was no longer needed. Sitting on the hill, Milo understood that helping a friend had made the journey brighter.
